  "traits": "Recommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Dex, +1 int\nSpeed: 35 feet.\nSkill Proficiencies: Nature, (Athletics or Chakra Control, pick one).\nStorm Release Affinity: You begin with either Water or Lightning Release affinity. (Pick one)\nStorm Techniques: The Ranton Clan has access to a separate list of Jutsu unique to their Clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the Normal jutsu list(s). They do not need both Nature Release’s to use their Clan jutsu.\nHijutsu Flexibility: Ranton Clan Hijutsu can use either Dexterity or Intelligence as its casting ability score.\nBranch Family: The Ranton are split between two different branches, the [Storm Branch] and the [Reezaa Branch]. The storm branch are warrior who enhance their physical body with lightning release, in the form of a chakra cloak reinforcing their durability and strength. The Reezaa branch is capable of creating flexible beams of energy that can curve and shift direction. This determines some clan features or which Hijutsu you gain/have access to. This cannot be changed later",
